# games/hello golden scenario: the start, a jump, two spawns, a second jump, 200 ticks later.
# Tick counts are 60 Hz ticks (scaled for the 120 Hz recording). `golden LABEL` takes a WARP shot.
seed 7
size 320x180
step 30
golden start
press jump 1
step 45
golden jump
pointer 0 -4 2 down
step 1
pointer 0 -4 2 up
step 1
pointer 0 6 -1 down
step 1
pointer 0 6 -1 up
step 120
press jump 1
step 200
golden end
